Level 1 — Basic
Q1 Find all employees whose age is 30 or greater.
Q2 Return each employee's name, salary, and city. Do not return _id.
Q3 Return all employees ordered from highest salary to lowest salary.
Q4 Return the 5 highest-paid employees.
Q5 Find all employees whose salary is greater than 50,000 and return only their name and salary.
Solutions:
db.employees.aggregate([{$match:{age:{$gte:30}}}])
db.employees.aggregate([{$project:{_id:0,name:1,salary:1,"address.city":1}}])
db.employees.aggregate([{$sort:{salary:-1}}])
db.employees.aggregate([{$sort:{salary:-1}},{$limit:5}])
db.employees.aggregate([{$match:{salary:{$gt:50000}}},{$project:{_id:0,name:1,salary:1,}}])


