🟡 Level 2 — Statistics
Q6 Calculate the total salary paid to all employees.
Q7 Calculate the average salary of all employees.
Q8 For each city, find the number of employees working there.

Q9 For each city, calculate:
Number of employees
Total salary
Average salary
Highest salary
Lowest salary

Q10 Consider only employees whose salary is 50,000 or more.
For each city, find:
Number of employees
Average salary

Solutions:
db.employees.aggregate([{$group:{_id:null,totalSalary:{$sum:"$salary"}}}])
db.employees.aggregate([{$group:{_id:null,avgSalary:{$avg:"$salary"}}}])
db.employees.aggregate([{$group:{_id:"$address.city",totalEmployees:{$sum:1}}}])
db.employees.aggregate([{$group:{_id:"$address.city",totalSalary:{$sum:"$salary"},avgSalary:{$avg:"$salary"},highestSalary:{$max:"$salary"},lowestSalary:{$min:"$salary"}}}])
db.employees.aggregate([{$match:{salary:{$gte:50000}}},{$group:{_id:"$address.city",avgSalary:{$avg:"$salary"},totalEmployees:{$sum:1}}}])


