Level 4 — Arrays & Multiple Collections
Q16 Each employee has a skills array.
Produce a result where each employee-skill combination appears as a separate document.
For example, if Ali has:
skills: ["react", "node", "mongodb"]
the result should contain three records for Ali.

Q17 Determine how many employees have each skill.
For example:
{
  skill: "react",
  employeeCount: 8
}
Sort the results from the skill with the highest employee count to the lowest.

Q18 The employees collection contains a departmentId, and the departments collection contains the corresponding department information.
Return each employee together with their department information.
Keep the department information grouped inside the employee result.

Q19 Using the employee and department information, return:
employeeName
departmentName
For example:
{
  employeeName: "Ali",
  departmentName: "Engineering"
}
Employees without a matching department should not appear in the final result.

🔥 Q20 — Final Interview Challenge
You need a salary report for management.
Consider only employees who:
are older than 25
earn 50,000 or more
For each city, calculate:
Number of employees
Average salary
Highest salary
Lowest salary
Then show only the 2 cities with the highest average salary.

Solutions:
db.employees.aggregate([{$unwind:"$skills"}])
db.employees.aggregate([{$unwind:"$skills"},{$group:{_id:"$skills",employeeCount:{$sum:1}}},{$sort:{employeeCount:-1}},{$project:{_id:0,skills:"$_id",employeeCount:1}}])
db.employees.aggregate([{$lookup:{from:"departments",localField:"departmentId",foreignField:"_id",as:"department_information"}}])
db.employees.aggregate([{$lookup:{from:"departments",localField:"departmentId",foreignField:"_id",as:"department_information"}},{$unwind:"$department_information"},{$project:{employeeName:"$name",departmentName:"$department_information.name",_id:0}}])
db.employees.aggregate([{$match:{salary:{$gte:50000},age:{$gt:25}}},{$group:{_id:"$address.city",avgSalary:{$avg:"$salary"},totalEmployees:{$sum:1},highestSalary:{$max:"$salary"},lowestSalary:{$min:"$salary"}}},{$sort:{"avgSalary":-1}},{$limit:2}])
